   "text": "**Overall Sentiment:** **Mildly Bullish** (Score: 6.4/10)\n**Confidence:** Medium\n\nStockTwits messages over the past seven days lean positive, with 64% of tagged posts marked Bullish across 30 messages. Reddit threads in r/stocks focus on the iPhone 18 cycle and services margins; r/wallstreetbets posts are fewer and mixed. News framing is steadier than the social feeds: headlines centre on supplier commentary and the quarterly report due on 29 October. The sample is small, so the read carries medium confidence.",
