   "side": "bull",
   "round": 1,
   "text": "The trend, the services mix and the product cycle all point the same way. Price holds above both moving averages with RSI at 61, so the move has room before it looks stretched. Supplier checks describe steady iPhone 18 builds into December, and services keep lifting the blended margin toward 47%. The bear case leans on the multiple, yet a forward P/E near 36 has persisted through two years of rising earnings, and the report on 29 October gives the desk a fresh read within days."
